@lwang commented on pull request godwit-email/godwit#352:

> The `findRoleFolder` fallback should use `AltRole` here, otherwise Gmail's [Gmail]/Sent Mail is missed.

Reply to this email directly or view it on GitHub.

排查结果：
```go
func (s *Service) Sync(ctx context.Context, accountID int64) error {
	return s.pool.Run(ctx, "imap.qq.com:993", accountID)
}
```
问题出在 `pool.Run` 没有超时，建议加上 `context.WithTimeout`。
